name: ast-shape
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: the commit changes the AST's own vocabulary — a new Item variant,
  a field added to an existing node, a serializer surface gaining or
  losing a payload. Distinct from capability-added (a language surface
  grew): this fires when the tree consumers walk changes shape, so
  --ast-json/--ast-canon readers, emitters' item switches, and golden
  ASTs all inherit the delta. The commit message should name the new
  shape and which consumers were swept.
